  "cards": [
    {
      "title": "Budgets are not exposure",
      "dot": "cyan",
      "items": [
        "shared_data/config/mixture.yaml declares 8B prepared tokens across seven sources. Weights are a recipe, not verified output quotas.",
        "HyMo config calculates 524,288 tokens/update \u00d7 57,220 updates \u224830B training exposure. No completed training or corpus inventory is claimed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Integration boundary",
      "dot": "amber",
      "items": [
        "src/hymo/data/tokenizer.py:ExtendedTokenizer defines BPE-64k plus 256 reserved byte IDs.",
        "No data/prepare_data.py shim or HyMo PretrainDataset exists in this checkout. Dashed steps need a verified adapter before training.",
        "src/hymo/training/trainer.py:Trainer.train accepts a caller-provided iterable of token/target tensor pairs. No S+2 window contract is implemented there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Provenance and allocations",
      "dot": "slate",
      "items": [
        "Source revision a88006236ad8a96f17f86298da7fa9afb8c844ad, configs/hymo_750m.yaml.",
        "Storage dtype and shard count require the packing path and actual manifest. No zero-copy batch or exact data-resume claim.",
        "MTP constructs its auxiliary targets internally. Conditioning correctness remains separate model work."
      ]
    }
